   \& Hlth; Int Council Res \& Innovat Bldg \& Construct; European Commiss
   Asia Pro Eco Programme Promot Sustainable Solut Environm Europe \& Asia;
   Korean Soc Indoor Environm; Soc Indoor Environm},
Abstract = {A new pattern of domestic air conditioner system with a water cooling
   condenser parallel connected with an air cooling condenser is set up in
   our laboratory, the condenser heat can not only be discharged directly
   into outdoor air by an air cooling condenser outside the room in the
   traditional way, but can also be recovered by a running water cooling
   condenser inside the room, in this way, condenser heat is stop
   discharged into outdoor environment and finally introduced into sewage
   system with the running water after domestic used. Experimental studies
   on air cooling pattern and water cooling pattern are made both in
   separate operation and in parallel operation. Experimental data are
   shown, and corresponding operational performance analysis are presented
   in this paper, which can be taken as a reference to the development of
   this new technique.},
