   of individual psychological factors on coal miners of unsafe behavior
   and its reasons through statistical investigation on accident cases, and
   gives corresponding preventive measures. Eight states of mind are put
   forward through the analysis on hundreds of deaths reported in Kailuan
   Group during last decades, which are psychology of luck, psychology of
   carelessness, psychology of Shortcut, psychology of forcefulness,
   psychology of escaping, psychology of showing off, psychology of
   fearfulness, Psychology of rebelliousness,Research and analysis of
   various manifestations of psychological insecurity can guarantee that
   the psychological frustration, fatigue, lack of sleep and physiological
   characteristics of puberty give rise to various psychological state,
   therefore suggestions are given to prevent a variety of psychological
   insecurity, including education on safety, improvement of the quality of
   workers, and adaption of workers' ideological work and emotion, and
   enhancement of coal mine equipment and working environment},
