   WREP 2014},
Year = {2014},
Pages = {421-428},
Note = {International Conference on Water Resource and Environmental Protection
   (WREP), Hong Kong, PEOPLES R CHINA, JUN 07-08, 2014},
Abstract = {The integration of water quality monitoring method and 3S technique
   produce on-board real-time water quality monitoring method. It can be
   used to analyze temporal and special variation of water quality and
   identify point source pollution in polluted rural-urban continuum. Based
   on this field on-board real-time water quality monitoring method and
   GIS, the tributary of Wen-Rui Tang River (Hualong Qiao) was chosen as
   typical case to study. This study suggests that where a sudden decrease
   of DO value correspond to the point source pollution position. This
   study also suggests that the decreasing rate of DO value was linear
   correlation with quantity of pollutant discharged. It can be useful for
   on-board real-time water quality monitoring method to identify and
   assess watershed point source pollution.},
