   Zhongjing Century Investment Co LTD},
Abstract = {Based on the present situation of the water resources shortage in Hebei
   province and the development of water rights status, an index system
   about water resources allocation use rights has been presented according
   to the principle of fair, efficient and continuous in the water
   resources use rights allocation, which comprehensively combines the
   influence factor of society, economy and environment. With the help of
   AHP method, an allocation model of water resources use rights is
   proposed, and the water resources allocation quantity is then calculated
   in the south-to-north water diversion middle route first-stage project.
   Contrasting to the factual water distribution quantity, the results
   indicate that the model has definite practical significances for
   allocating water resources rationally and utilizing water resources
   continuously in Hebei Province.},
