Abstract = {The concept of a near-Earth object (NEO) impact projection metric (PM)
   based on the ratio of the observation time to the impact time, p(t), for
   a projected NEO impact is developed. The PM can assist NEO mitigation
   decision-making that is based on the discontinuously changing cumulative
   impact probability and help mitigate false alarms of NEO impact with
   Earth that have undermined public perception toward the veracity of
